{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object detected, grab it. Then check properties, do task, drop it. Move or scan area for more.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = DropObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    />",
